        "Scaling an unclear offer can multiply confusion, refunds, and costs. Improve the underlying process first.",
        "10.5 Expand only when evidence supports it\nOnce one audience, offer, and acquisition path work reasonably consistently, consider:\n- Improving the existing product.\n- Adding a related product for the same audience.\n- Creating a higher-support version.\n- Documenting and automating repetitive tasks.\n- Adding a second distribution channel.\n- Hiring specialist help for a clearly defined bottleneck.",
