        "Worksheet C: Unique Value Zone\nComplete the statement:\nI help [audience] solve [problem] so they can [outcome], using [method or deliverable], without [important friction].\n\nThen check:\n- Is the audience recognisable?\n- Is the problem concrete?\n- Does the outcome matter to the audience?\n- Can I credibly help?\n- Is the promise within my control?\n- Can a buyer understand the offer quickly?",
